{"4127000": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Frozen Stillness", "steam_appid": 4127000, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Frozen Silence</i></strong> is a short yet intense and exhausting pixel-art story about the survival of a father and daughter on a planet that was once their home, but has now become a deadly trap. Monitor your condition and use an energy shield and weapons to survive on this frozen planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127000/extras/65f5e122c78fc81c28dabda61ed6f18b.poster.avif?t=1774852552\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127000/extras/65f5e122c78fc81c28dabda61ed6f18b.webm?t=1774852552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127000/extras/65f5e122c78fc81c28dabda61ed6f18b.mp4?t=1774852552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What Awaits You:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On this planet, no one welcomes you — and no mistakes are forgiven:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Every new enemy or weather phenomenon can become deadly.<br>• Use your equipment wisely: different types of energy shields work best against different threats.<br>• Your ultimate goal is to get yourself <i>and your daughter</i> out of this mess. Manage your resources wisely between the characters.<br>• The ending of your journey depends solely on you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127000/extras/252094690adc70c1df5dba061fae0878.poster.avif?t=1774852552\" width=1170 height=658 ><sou